The legal texts come from the Biblioteca y Archivo Central del Congreso Nacional of Paraguay:

  Source: Biblioteca y Archivo Central del Congreso Nacional (BACN), Leyes Paraguayas,
  https://www.bacn.gov.py/leyes-paraguayas, retrieved 28 October 2026.

BACN states no licence for its pages. They are official legal texts of the Republic of Paraguay, which are public.

Changes made by Lexifina: each page was converted to one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line; spacing,
quotes and dashes were normalised; BACN's "(Modificado por ...)" notes were removed from article headings and used
only to credit the amending law; and the versions were arranged as git commits credited to the laws that made each
change. The wording of the law was not changed. Where an earlier version was rebuilt from an amending act, the text
comes from that act as BACN publishes it. BACN does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
